# The whole plugin on an ordinary account: started as RuneLite starts it, logged in at Lumbridge,
# walking, hurt and healed, gaining experience, hearing the game's chat, seeing an NPC and another
# player, the bank changing, standing still for a minute, hopping worlds, logging out, then
# turned off, turned on again and logged in once more.
#
# Nothing is expected of what it shows: the replay fails if any of the plugin's event handlers,
# its start or its stop throws. The scene is schematic, not the real map.
#
# Facts (RuneLite's gameval ItemID): SHARK "Shark", COINS "Coins", _4DOSEPRAYERRESTORE
# "Prayer potion(4)", RUNE_SCIMITAR "Rune scimitar". The chat lines are the game's own wording
# for a kill count and a death.

scene 3200 3200
skill ATTACK 60
skill STRENGTH 60
skill DEFENCE 60
skill HITPOINTS 60
skill PRAYER 45
skill RANGED 60
skill MAGIC 60
skill MINING 60
skill THIEVING 60
skill SLAYER 50
skill FARMING 50
skill WOODCUTTING 60
item SHARK "Shark" price 800
item COINS "Coins" price 1 stacks
item _4DOSEPRAYERRESTORE "Prayer potion(4)" price 9000
item RUNE_SCIMITAR "Rune scimitar" price 15000
items INV SHARK 10
items INV COINS 100000 stacked
items INV _4DOSEPRAYERRESTORE 4
items WORN RUNE_SCIMITAR 1
at 3222 3218
login
tick 12

walk 3226 3222
tick 5
xp ATTACK 300000
boost HITPOINTS 20
tick 3
boost HITPOINTS 60
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Your Sarachnis kill count is: 52."
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Oh dear, you are dead!"
chat SPAM "You catch some shrimps."
npc 100 "Goblin" 3227 3223 1 level 5 as goblin
player "Another player" 3224 3220
tick 5
remove goblin

items BANK SHARK 500 stacked
items BANK COINS 5000000 stacked
tick 3
items INV clear
items INV SHARK 3
tick 110

# A world hop, as the game sends it.
state HOPPING
tick 2
state LOADING
tick 1
state LOGGED_IN
tick 20

state LOGIN_SCREEN
tick 3

# Off and on again in the plugin list, then back in.
shutdown
startup
login
tick 5
shutdown
